              "text": "निकळणो — nikaḷṇo — \"to set out; to come out\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हूं काल तड़कै घर सूं निकळसूं। hū̃ kāl taṛkai ghar sū̃ nikaḷsū̃. Tomorrow I'll set out from home at daybreak."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): वो तड़कै निकळ्यो, vo taṛkai nikaḷyo."
            }
          ]
        },
