          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "निकळणो (nikaḷṇo) is inherited from a reconstructed niṣkalati, \"comes out\"; CDIAL lists the Old Marwari verb nikalaï, with the same sense, under it (CDIAL 7478)."
            }
